#===============================================================================
#  ARDHANARISHVARA OS — ENGINEERING SUPPORT DOCUMENT
#  SovereignOS Identity & Access Engine
#  File: identity_access_engine.support
#===============================================================================
#  PURPOSE:
#    Engineering reference for the SovereignOS identity & access engine:
#      • identity registry
#      • authentication tokens
#      • role-based access control
#      • permission evaluation
#      • session lifecycle
#      • audit logging
#
#===============================================================================
#  MODULE SUMMARY:
#
#    - [Identity Registry](ca://s?q=Explain_Identity_Registry)
#    - [Authentication](ca://s?q=Explain_Kernel_Authentication)
#    - [RBAC](ca://s?q=Explain_Role_Based_Access_Control)
#    - [Permission Checks](ca://s?q=Explain_Permission_Checks)
#    - [Audit Logging](ca://s?q=Explain_Audit_Logging)
#
#===============================================================================
#  FUNCTION OVERVIEW:
#
#    - create_identity(name, secret, roles)
#         Creates identity object.
#
#    - define_role(name, permissions)
#         Defines RBAC role.
#
#    - authenticate(identity_id, secret)
#         Creates session + token.
#
#    - validate(session_id, token)
#         Validates session.
#
#    - check(session_id, token, permission)
#         Evaluates permission.
#
#    - end_session(session_id)
#         Ends session.
#
#    - log(event, meta)
#         Writes audit log entry.
#
#    - snapshot()
#         Returns IAE state.
#
#===============================================================================
#  IDENTITY STRUCTURE FORMAT:
#
#    {
#      "id": "ID-XXXX",
#      "name": "admin",
#      "roles": ["root", "system"],
#      "secret": <bytes>
#    }
#
